Package: cnftctl
Version: @DEBIAN_VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Calmcacil B. <716671+calmcacil@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/calmcacil/cnftctl
Depends: nftables, systemd
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: guarded nftables host firewall manager
 cnftctl manages the application-owned inet hostfw nftables profile on
 Debian 13 amd64. It provides immutable policy generations, systemd-owned
 rollback, optional DDNS SSH allowlists, and strict Docker WAN gating.
